{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "goal",
    "description": "**用途与调用规则**\n\n- 管理本会话的长任务目标与进度账本。用 op 选择操作：\n\n| op | 什么时候用 | 结果 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| propose | 用户交代多阶段、需要多轮推进或明确要求“持续做完”的任务，且本会话没有进行中的目标；或用户要求修改目标 | 弹出目标卡等待用户确认，确认后目标生效 |\n| record | 取得带证据的阶段结论、规划或完成待办、某条路径失败时 | 写入进度账本，后续轮次从账本继续 |\n| complete | 认为每个验收项都有结论支撑、必需待办已完成时 | 系统核验；未通过时返回缺口并生成补救待办，继续推进 |\n| block | 只有用户才能提供的决定、数据或权限阻止继续推进时 | 目标转为受阻，等待用户处理 |\n\n- 对明确持续完成的多阶段任务，首个工具批次只提交 propose；连接探查和数据查询安排在用户确认之后。\n- 简单问答、一次查询能回答的问题不要 propose。\n- propose 的验收项写成可核对的陈述，每项能由一条带证据的结论支撑；约束写口径、范围和禁止事项；预算不超过默认值，除非用户指定。\n- 修改已有目标时 propose 需带 goalId 与 expectedRevision（取自目标锚点）。\n- record 的结论必须引用本轮 evidenceIds；同一事实使用稳定的 factKey，便于发现冲突。数值写 value 与 unit。\n- 待办用于跨轮推进：每个阶段开始前登记，完成后标记 done。必需待办未完成时无法完成目标。\n- 失败也要 record，写明尝试过什么、为什么失败，避免后续轮次重复。\n- complete 被打回时，按返回的 gaps 补齐，不要立即重复申请。\n- block 不用于普通的工具错误或空结果；可以换方法继续时继续。\n- 目标的创建、修改、恢复以用户确认为准；预算和状态以目标锚点为准。",
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "$defs": {
        "BlockGoal": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "op": {
              "const": "block",
              "title": "Op",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "reason": {
              "maxLength": 60,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Reason",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": ["op", "reason"],
          "title": "BlockGoal",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "CompleteGoal": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "op": {
              "const": "complete",
              "title": "Op",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "expectedRevision": {
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Expectedrevision",
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "required": ["op", "expectedRevision"],
          "title": "CompleteGoal",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "GoalAcceptance": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "id": {
              "pattern": "^a[0-9]{1,2}$",
              "title": "Id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "text": {
              "maxLength": 300,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Text",
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": ["id", "text"],
          "title": "GoalAcceptance",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "GoalBudget": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "maxRounds": {
              "default": 12,
              "maximum": 32,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Maxrounds",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "tokens": {
              "default": 2000000,
              "maximum": 10000000,
              "minimum": 10000,
              "title": "Tokens",
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "costMicrousd": {
              "default": 20000000,
              "maximum": 20000000,
              "minimum": 1,
              "title": "Costmicrousd",
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "title": "GoalBudget",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "GoalContract": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "objective": {
              "maxLength": 2000,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Objective",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "acceptance": {
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/GoalAcceptance"
              },
              "maxItems": 10,
              "minItems": 1,
              "title": "Acceptance",
              "type": "array"
            },
            "constraints": {
              "items": {
                "maxLength": 500,
                "minLength": 1,
                "type": "string"
              },
              "maxItems": 10,
              "title": "Constraints",
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          "required": ["objective", "acceptance"],
          "title": "GoalContract",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "LedgerItem": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "type": {
              "enum": ["conclusion", "todo", "todo_done", "failure"],
              "title": "Type",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "key": {
              "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_.:-]{1,80}$",
              "title": "Key",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "title": {
              "maxLength": 200,
              "minLength": 1,
              "title": "Title",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "text": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "maxLength": 2000,
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Text"
            },
            "evidenceIds": {
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "maxItems": 8,
              "title": "Evidenceids",
              "type": "array"
            },
            "factKey": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "pattern": "^[a-z0-9_.:-]{1,80}$",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Factkey"
            },
            "value": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Value"
            },
            "unit": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "maxLength": 20,
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Unit"
            },
            "acceptanceIds": {
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "maxItems": 10,
              "title": "Acceptanceids",
              "type": "array"
            },
            "dependsOn": {
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "maxItems": 16,
              "title": "Dependson",
              "type": "array"
            },
            "resolves": {
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "maxItems": 10,
              "title": "Resolves",
              "type": "array"
            },
            "required": {
              "default": true,
              "title": "Required",
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": ["type", "key", "title"],
          "title": "LedgerItem",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "ProposeGoal": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "op": {
              "const": "propose",
              "title": "Op",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "contract": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/GoalContract"
            },
            "budget": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/GoalBudget"
            },
            "goalId": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "pattern": "^[a-f0-9]{8}(-[a-f0-9]{4}){3}-[a-f0-9]{12}$",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Goalid"
            },
            "expectedRevision": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "minimum": 1,
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              ],
              "default": null,
              "title": "Expectedrevision"
            }
          },
          "required": ["op", "contract"],
          "title": "ProposeGoal",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "RecordProgress": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "op": {
              "const": "record",
              "title": "Op",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "items": {
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/LedgerItem"
              },
              "maxItems": 10,
              "minItems": 1,
              "title": "Items",
              "type": "array"
            }
          },
          "required": ["op", "items"],
          "title": "RecordProgress",
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "discriminator": {
        "mapping": {
          "block": "#/$defs/BlockGoal",
          "complete": "#/$defs/CompleteGoal",
          "propose": "#/$defs/ProposeGoal",
          "record": "#/$defs/RecordProgress"
        },
        "propertyName": "op"
      },
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/ProposeGoal"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/RecordProgress"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/CompleteGoal"
        },
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/BlockGoal"
        }
      ],
      "title": "GoalInput"
    }
  },
  "examples": []
}
